            "review_title": "Review at The December Co.",
            "review_text": "thanhnga0703\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam58 contributions\n0\nCozy Coffee Place in the center of Saigon\nOct 2016 • Couples\ni first came here because of its reputation of crossaint but too bad that we came in weekend afternoon, no crossaint left :(. If you want to taste Crossant here, try to come in the morning.\nThe price is acceptable to us, I tried Sau dam, special drink of Ha Noi and it was really nice. I also tried cake with salty egg and the taste is awesome. \nthis coffee shop locates in 1st floor at old building on Ly Tu Trong street, not difficult to find with fine decoration and friendly staff. If you wander around the center and try to find a nice place for a cup of coffee or delicious cake, I believe this place is worth your visit.\nRead more\nWritten October 16, 2016",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-14",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
