            "review_title": "Review at The December Co.",
            "review_text": "Maryellen G\nVancouver, Canada84 contributions\n0\nCalm Cool Cafe in District 1!\nMay 2016 • Solo\nPristine, cool Cafe in D1, hidden on a second floor, beside La Fenetre soleil. Serves great coffee, and excellent croissants. Nice place to chill out, or get some work done. Strong wifi and good service! I believe they also serve beer and wine and have a small balcony for those who want to gaze onto Ly Ty Trong.\nWritten May 26, 2016",
