            "review_text": "Salvy\nNew York City, New York525 contributions\n0\nHidden coffee shop\nMar 2016 • Friends\nA hidden fashion + coffee shop in an old apartment. The menu is not various but the cakes are very delicious. Although the shop is quite small (there are some tables in the balcony), the decoration is chic and minimal, which is suitable for couples or small groups gathering. Service is good but takes time to get the drinks since there is only one waiter + bartender. Overall a nice place, worth a visit.\nRead more\nWritten March 15, 2016",
